# Splice onto Arcane (CR 702.47): Bot1 entombs Headliner Scarlett, then answers Bot2's Lightning Bolt with We Say Thee Nay! and splices Goryo's Vengeance onto it. The spliced text has a target of its own, chosen after the spell's (CR 601.2c): Scarlett returns with haste and is exiled at the end step, while the Bolt, whose caster cannot pay {2}, is countered.

